  "adaptation": "One-metre plan snapping and two full native wall courses preserve reuse. Published one-and-half-storey proportions are interpreted with new roof envelopes around the full upper native course; eaves, roof panels and removable clapboard gable facings are new art. Colors, rear surfaces, furnishings, opening spacing and consolidated closets/circulation are interpretations. Cellars are described but no cellar partition plans are published for these designs; none are invented as extra interiors."
